Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: scala
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/scala/bug
Source: https://github.com/scala/scala
Comment:
 The upstream tarball is repacked (+ds) to remove files that are not in the
 preferred form for modification or are not DFSG free; see Files-Excluded.
 .
 Only the Scala compiler and standard library JARs (Apache-2.0, EPFL and
 Lightbend, plus the BSD-3-clause Scalax files in scalap.jar) are shipped
 in the binary packages. The third-party web assets and fonts listed below
 live in the source tree (scaladoc resources and the language
 specification) and are documented here for completeness.
 .
 Of the Files-Excluded entries, the native test fixtures, the sbt-test
 jars and the minified highlight.pack.js have no preferred-form source in
 the tree. The Luxi fonts (Bigelow & Holmes) are under a licence that is
 not DFSG free. admin/files/scala-key.asc.enc and spec/id_dsa_travis.enc
 are encrypted keys for upstream's release and spec-publishing CI, opaque
 data with no source. spec/public/images/classhierarchy.pdf is a rendered
 copy of a figure whose source is not in the tree (the spec uses
 classhierarchy.png). None of them is used by the build: the language
 specification (spec/) is not built, and admin/ holds only upstream CI
 scripts.
Files-Excluded:
 test/files/jvm/libnatives-32.so
 test/files/jvm/libnatives-64.so
 test/files/jvm/natives-32.dll
 test/files/jvm/natives-64.dll
 test/files/jvm/libnatives-x86.jnilib
 test/files/jvm/libnatives-arm.jnilib
 test/sbt-test/source-dependencies/canon/actual/a.jar
 test/sbt-test/source-dependencies/canon/lib/a.jar
 spec/public/scripts/highlight.pack.js
 spec/public/fonts/LuxiMono-*.woff
 spec/public/fonts/LuxiSans-*.woff
 admin/files/scala-key.asc.enc
 spec/id_dsa_travis.enc
 spec/public/images/classhierarchy.pdf

